[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11104.469, "timestamp": "03:05:04", "text": "这是判断是否……的一种简单方法。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11106.07, "timestamp": "03:05:06", "text": "船正驶向你还是驶离你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11121.87, "timestamp": "03:05:21", "text": "好的。锐利"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11124.71, "timestamp": "03:05:24", "text": "转弯。你离船很近。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11126.83, "timestamp": "03:05:26", "text": "而且呈一定角度。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11129.67, "timestamp": "03:05:29", "text": "所以，首先要努力支持它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11138.349, "timestamp": "03:05:38", "text": "另外，在你做那份工作的时候，是的，测验"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11143.269, "timestamp": "03:05:43", "text": "关于飞机。好的。世界"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11145.269, "timestamp": "03:05:45", "text": "第一次世界大战和第二次世界大战，所有这些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11148.389, "timestamp": "03:05:48", "text": "螺旋桨飞机上装有武器。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11155.11, "timestamp": "03:05:55", "text": "他们过去常常，你知道，指着"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11157.269, "timestamp": "03:05:57", "text": "敌机与敌机交战，他们使用了"}]